Independently develop further JUnit tests for the remaining methods of the Calculator class. The pipeline automatically loads all test classes from the test/ directory. Continue working with the issue board and merge requests. 

Example for an exception test:
@Test
@DisplayName("Division by zero should throw IllegalArgumentException")
void testDivisionByZero() {
assertThrows(IllegalArgumentException.class, () -> calculator.divide(5, 0));
}

exercises.correct_answer:
